{
  "sourceLanguage": "zh-Hans",
  "strings": {
    "菜单栏图标已隐藏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu Bar Icon Hidden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "屏跃仍在后台运行，全局快捷键可正常使用。\n你可以重新显示菜单栏图标，或退出 App。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "DisplayHop is still running in the background and global shortcuts keep working.\nYou can show the menu bar icon again, or quit the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "显示菜单栏图标": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Menu Bar Icon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移动到下一屏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move to Next Display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移动到上一屏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move to Previous Display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设置…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "检查辅助功能权限…": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Check Accessibility Permission…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "退出屏跃": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Quit DisplayHop"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "快捷键": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Shortcuts"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "通用": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "General"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "窗口跨屏移动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move Window Across Displays"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移动的是当前聚焦的窗口，并保持其在屏幕中的相对位置。全屏窗口会先退出全屏再移动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moves the focused window and keeps its relative position on screen. Fullscreen windows exit fullscreen before moving."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图标已隐藏。重新打开屏跃时会自动弹出本设置窗口，可在这里恢复显示。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icon hidden. Reopen DisplayHop to bring up this settings window and re-enable it here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "登录时启动屏跃": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Launch DisplayHop at Login"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "启动": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Startup"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Permissions"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "辅助功能": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已授权": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Granted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "前往系统设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要辅助功能权限才能读取和移动其他应用的窗口。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility permission is required to read and move windows of other apps."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "菜单栏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Menu Bar"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "诊断": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Diagnostics"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "上次操作": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Last Operation"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "结果": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Result"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "显示器": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Displays"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "数量": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Count"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "未授权": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not Granted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "已移动到": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Moved to"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "没有聚焦窗口": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No focused window"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "辅助功能未授权": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility not granted"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "只有一块屏幕": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Only one display"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "移动失败（AX 写入失败）": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Move failed (AX write failed)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "尚未执行": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not yet run"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "执行一次移动快捷键后，这里会显示结果。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Run a move shortcut and the result shows up here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "辅助功能权限与「App 二进制」绑定。重新构建或重新安装后需要重新授权，否则快捷键会触发但窗口不会移动。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility permission is bound to the app binary. After rebuilding or reinstalling, you must grant it again — otherwise the shortcut fires but the window won't move."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "需要辅助功能权限": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility Permission Required"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "辅助功能权限用于读取和移动其他应用的窗口。授权后快捷键才能生效。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Accessibility permission is used to read and move windows of other apps. Shortcuts only work once it is granted."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "打开系统设置": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Open System Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "稍后再说": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Later"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "显示程序坞图标": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Show Dock Icon"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图标已全部隐藏": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "All Icons Hidden"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "菜单栏图标和程序坞图标都已隐藏，屏跃仍在后台运行，全局快捷键可正常使用。\n你可以重新显示其中任意一个图标，或退出 App。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both the menu bar and Dock icons are hidden. DisplayHop keeps running in the background and global shortcuts still work.\nYou can show either icon again, or quit the app."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "两个图标都已隐藏，屏跃将在后台运行，只能用快捷键操作。\n重新打开屏跃时会弹出提示，可在这里恢复。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Both icons are hidden. DisplayHop runs in the background and can only be controlled with shortcuts.\nReopen DisplayHop to get a prompt, or restore them here."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "图标": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Icons"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "version": "1.0"
}